DESCRIPTION:Learn about FSU’s Honors in the Major and IDEA Grant funding opportunities with Professor Carrie Ann Baade\, art students and alumni.\n\n \n\nTuesday\, October 27\, 11:30 am\n\nThe session will be held in FAB 249\n\nPresented by the BA Studio Art Program\n\n \n\nSession Presenters Include:\n\n*Professor Carrie Ann Baade\, Department of Art\, HITM Liaison\n\n*BA student Anna Garufo\, currently enrolled in HITM and a recent Idea Grant awardee\n\n*Alumna Raven Watkins\, graduated with HITM and recipient of the Tyler Grant\n\nPresentations will be followed by a Q&A.\n\nWe hope to see you there!\n\n \n\nArtwork by Allie Zieper\, BA Honors in Studio Art.
GEO:30.44416;-84.289845
LOCATION:Fine Arts Building (FAB)\, 249
SUMMARY:HITM & IDEA Grant BA Student Info Session
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/hitm-idea-grant-ba-student-info-session
