DESCRIPTION:Oct. 29\, 2026\, 5:00 p.m.-7:00 p.m.\nFAB Gallery\n\nThis exhibition will be a culmination project from the hybrid class "Unstill Life\," taught by Jean Shon and nia love. The exhibition features photographs of the body in relation to historically contested sites in Tallahassee.
