DESCRIPTION:Tim Hawkinson – Thursday\, November 5th\, 2026 @ 6:00 pm in FAB 249\nTim Hawkinson creates complex\, idiosyncratic sculptures from everyday materials to explore identity\, time\, and mechanics.\n\nEach year\, the Florida State University Department of Art’s Visiting Artist Program brings leading studio artists from around the world to Tallahassee. Their interactive artist talks give all art students the opportunity to engage and build connections with these talented and innovative artists. Hand selected by a faculty committee\, these artists represent a wide variety of disciplines and experiences and come ready to share their work and inspire our students to expand their practices in exciting new ways.
GEO:30.44416;-84.289845
LOCATION:Fine Arts Building (FAB)\, 249
SUMMARY:Visiting Artist Talk: Tim Hawkinson
